# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# Firebase. Not a secret (it ships inside the APK) but it belongs to whoever owns the Play
# listing, and a checked-in copy is how a fork ends up pushing notifications through somebody
# else's project. See docs/edge-functions.md → push-send.
android/app/google-services.json
ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist
